      "content": "That's a strong start. It really hits the tone I'm looking for. \n\nCan you add a part to that paragraph that briefly mentions how managed conservation projects often just end up being expensive, superficial band-aids that don't actually fix the underlying problems? I want to make sure the reviewers see it as a failed strategy.",
